OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFrequent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy showers in the
OL,7,Fevening, becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fisolated overnight, with more in the
OL,9,Fway of clear spells. Strong westerly
OL,10,Fwinds in the evening will start to
OL,11,Fease overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fscattered showers, the best of the dry
OL,15,Fweather towards Inverness and Nairn.
OL,16,FBreezy to start but winds becoming
OL,17,Flight through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
